1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,777
hovory Yasuie Fire

2
00:00:29,880 --> 00:00:30,710
One Piece!

3
00:00:30,793 --> 00:00:31,697
All of

4
00:00:51,165 --> 00:00:52,737
All of

5
00:01:19,180 --> 00:01:20,010
Oh!

6
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:21,250
Oh, as-as!

7
00:01:21,980 --> 00:01:23,540
As-as, as-as-as!

8
00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:35,850
Noooo...

9
00:01:38,080 --> 00:01:39,697
Watch where you're stepping!

10
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:40,937
You could've killed us!

11
00:01:41,020 --> 00:01:41,850
Oops!

12
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:43,150
Sorry!

13
00:01:47,520 --> 00:01:48,597
Look at you.

14
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:51,617
Bonnie's not the only one
who's hit a growth spurt.

15
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:54,460
ULA a finger on old mad apple.

16
00:01:55,400 --> 00:01:57,637
Listen, kids, some of us have jobs.

17
00:01:57,720 --> 00:02:00,400
Let me go back to doing mine, please.

18
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,357
Let you go.

19
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,620
Oh, OK!

20
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:07,380
Ah!

21
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:24,920
We're ready!

22
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:34,558
It's not necessary!

23
00:02:37,540 --> 00:02:39,240
Whoa, take it easy!

24
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:53,380
Look at him flying!

25
00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:00,857
We have to run now! Let's
hurry! Yeah, you're right!

26
00:03:00,940 --> 00:03:03,340
Let's go while Luffy keeps Kizaru busy.

27
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:06,300
Okay, but we have to be gentle with Robin.

28
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:10,260
Hey, Atlas! You see me?

29
00:03:10,780 --> 00:03:12,140
I'm going down below.

30
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,657
I have to take control of the pacifistas.

31
00:03:14,740 --> 00:03:18,300
Otherwise, as soon as
the barrier goes down...

32
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:24,513
Your lasers will blow us to smithereens!

33
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,315
That's good thinking!

34
00:03:26,620 --> 00:03:29,877
Us Vegapunks are the highest
authority on the island after all.

35
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:32,800
And whoever controls
the pacifist, it will!

36
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:34,560
Hell yeah!

37
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:35,882
We've got this!

38
00:03:36,660 --> 00:03:37,640
Atlas space!

39
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:40,540
That is what I mean to say.

40
00:03:41,060 --> 00:03:43,400
Please, take me with you! What?

41
00:03:44,440 --> 00:03:46,700
You cannot go! Why not?

42
00:03:47,180 --> 00:03:48,298
Are you kidding me?

43
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:51,497
There are 30,000 Marines out
there who all want you dead!

44
00:03:51,580 --> 00:03:53,037
I know, but...

45
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,720
Come in, Franky!

46
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,857
This is Vegapunk, can you hear me?

47
00:03:56,940 --> 00:03:57,770
What's up?

48
00:03:57,853 --> 00:03:59,739
I just saw Bonnie down in the city!

49
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,960
She's alive then?

50
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:04,940
What a relief, she hit the
barrier, Kizaru kicked her hard!

51
00:04:05,100 --> 00:04:08,335
Kizaru did hurt to her and
you just took the handbunch!

52
00:04:08,460 --> 00:04:09,800
You are a blue man!

53
00:04:10,140 --> 00:04:11,520
I'm sorry, okay?

54
00:04:11,860 --> 00:04:14,560
I'll go save her right now! You'd better!

55
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:17,409
But what are we gonna
do about the barrier?

56
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:21,060
I've made up my mind, I'm going! What?

57
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:23,969
They'll have Edison
deactivate the barrier!

58
00:04:27,440 --> 00:04:28,960
Hey, it's Surge!

59
00:04:29,960 --> 00:04:31,254
I heard what you said.

60
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:32,420
All of it.

61
00:04:35,640 --> 00:04:37,777
You're going to go in
and rescue her, right?

62
00:04:37,860 --> 00:04:39,480
Then you can count me in.

63
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:41,100
Our work here is done.

64
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:44,937
We picked up the luggage you
asked us to and we're on our way.

65
00:04:45,020 --> 00:04:47,537
I'll head toward the
rear exit immediately.

66
00:04:47,620 --> 00:04:49,032
Let's all meet up there.

67
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:50,900
Go! Go! Go!

68
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:55,720
Did something just move? Hey!

69
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:56,877
What are you doing?

70
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:59,300
It's this way. Hurry up! Yes, sir.

71
00:05:03,180 --> 00:05:05,180
I guess it's dangerous here, too.

72
00:05:18,580 --> 00:05:20,000
Come get some!

73
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:29,500
What was that scream?

74
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:32,060
Come in.

75
00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:33,220
What's going on?

76
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:36,770
Stop!

77
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:40,000
I know you.

78
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:43,170
Sure.

79
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:53,300
Central units, give me
a report. What happened?

80
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:54,680
Well done.

81
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:00,790
Ah!

82
00:06:16,860 --> 00:06:17,690
Dammit!

83
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:21,790
Reporting in!

84
00:06:21,873 --> 00:06:24,581
We've all been turned into
children or old people!

85
00:06:25,460 --> 00:06:26,290
What?

86
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:28,777
Everyone invade the center of town.

87
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:29,690
It's a trap!

88
00:06:30,140 --> 00:06:33,081
All central units were
ambushed by Jewelry Bonnie!

89
00:06:33,220 --> 00:06:35,573
Search the surrounding zones cautiously.

90
00:06:35,660 --> 00:06:37,836
She has the power to change your age!

91
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,780
She can't have got to war!

92
00:06:43,140 --> 00:06:45,460
Find Jewelry Bonnie and take her down!

93
00:06:47,960 --> 00:06:49,300
Damn it. Hey!

94
00:06:49,660 --> 00:06:50,720
Over here!

95
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,300
A fan said to Moria!

96
00:06:54,060 --> 00:06:55,080
But he...

97
00:06:56,140 --> 00:06:58,540
It looks like he's been burned.

98
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:00,520
Sentomaru.

99
00:07:13,580 --> 00:07:14,700
Sentomaru?

100
00:07:15,780 --> 00:07:17,940
Run away, Bonnie.

101
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:21,900
The Marines are coming.

102
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:35,300
What should I do? Have you found her?
Not yet, sir. Check that way. Yes, sir.

103
00:07:37,660 --> 00:07:40,380
I wonder if I can hide
until this is all over.

104
00:07:48,460 --> 00:07:50,560
Hey, just fight me already.

105
00:07:51,940 --> 00:07:54,517
You have nothing to
gain from this, Roronoa.

106
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:57,800
Stay out of our way and let us do our job.

107
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,880
It doesn't matter if you hide.

108
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:13,900
Doesn't matter how fast you run.

109
00:08:14,600 --> 00:08:16,520
I know right where you are.

110
00:08:18,160 --> 00:08:20,420
Cause you stink like a beast!

111
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,000
Huh?

112
00:09:04,580 --> 00:09:06,800
Whoa, was that Pigeon Guy?

113
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:09,680
Zoro, do you want my help?

114
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:15,320
Good luck, cat sitting.

115
00:09:16,040 --> 00:09:16,870
Ah!

116
00:09:20,640 --> 00:09:22,797
It's focus on Kizaru.

117
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:24,400
He's the real problem!

118
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:45,710
Ha!

119
00:09:45,793 --> 00:09:47,080
You're barely keeping up.

120
00:09:47,380 --> 00:09:52,262
If this is the best you can do, you're
never gonna get another shot at our captain.

121
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,030
Ha ha ha.

122
00:09:55,380 --> 00:09:56,757
But I've still got you.

123
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,657
An Emperor's first mate.

124
00:09:58,740 --> 00:10:00,460
That's a worthy trophy.

125
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,997
I might drown.

126
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:22,680
That won't do at all.

127
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:34,580
Yasakani, Sacred Jewel.

128
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:50,100
Hey, that's bright!

129
00:10:59,180 --> 00:11:02,260
I don't know how to do it.

130
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:24,200
No! My face!

131
00:11:37,820 --> 00:11:40,240
I've seen these!

132
00:11:40,400 --> 00:11:41,400
Hot glands!

133
00:11:45,880 --> 00:11:47,780
Stupid shining heart away!

134
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:57,520
Oh, come on, again with this?

135
00:12:18,980 --> 00:12:20,460
Well, it's fine.

136
00:12:20,760 --> 00:12:22,797
The bigger target is easier to hit.

137
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,233
So, thank you for that.

138
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:27,830
Huh?

139
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,845
I don't know which one's real!

140
00:12:56,500 --> 00:12:58,000
Just kidding!

141
00:12:58,620 --> 00:12:59,980
I'll hit them all!

142
00:13:00,520 --> 00:13:02,600
Dum-zum! Done!

143
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:06,530
Yeah!

144
00:13:36,260 --> 00:13:38,960
I thought I was the one tricking you!

145
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:41,400
Now this is unfortunate.

146
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:45,240
I leave for one second
and Vegapunk is gone.

147
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:47,915
Could you tell me where he is, please?

148
00:13:48,380 --> 00:13:51,100
I need a little help right now!

149
00:14:03,700 --> 00:14:05,300
Oh, Bad Apple!

150
00:14:06,500 --> 00:14:07,330
Wait!

151
00:14:07,413 --> 00:14:08,460
Hey, Vegapunk!

152
00:14:08,760 --> 00:14:09,760
Let me in there!

153
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:12,580
You're really worked up!

154
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:14,217
Not that I blame you, though.

155
00:14:14,300 --> 00:14:17,124
Won't you touch her, you
port-linking Navy scum?

156
00:14:17,320 --> 00:14:18,500
Never fear, Bonnie!

157
00:14:18,660 --> 00:14:20,440
I'm on my way! Stay strong!

158
00:14:20,760 --> 00:14:22,277
I should have protected you!

159
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:23,960
You poor darling child!

160
00:14:24,300 --> 00:14:25,820
Poor darling child!

161
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:27,060
Get in already!

162
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,340
I'll let you in the bubble!

163
00:14:29,660 --> 00:14:31,307
Just shove yourself through!

164
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:32,880
Well, if you say so.

165
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,917
What are you doing?!

166
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:44,400
Stay in the dope thing!

167
00:14:44,700 --> 00:14:46,660
You're gonna get killed out here!

168
00:14:49,260 --> 00:14:51,620
Did you think I'd just let you run?

169
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:56,060
This is over, old man.

170
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:58,820
Do something still, I can't go with that!

171
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,840
That's already...

172
00:15:22,360 --> 00:15:23,190
Doha!

173
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:24,420
Change of plans!

174
00:15:24,720 --> 00:15:27,367
We'll use General Franky
to carry the Sonny!

175
00:15:27,540 --> 00:15:28,370
Time!

176
00:15:28,453 --> 00:15:30,860
Catch and interact with these bros! Okay!

177
00:15:52,360 --> 00:15:53,190
Ah!

178
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:01,760
Angus-san, do it! Right away!

179
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:03,580
Frontier Dome!

180
00:16:03,980 --> 00:16:05,620
Partially deactivate!

181
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:09,140
Activate!

182
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,780
Can this thing fly?

183
00:16:25,540 --> 00:16:26,980
Wait, what's that?

184
00:16:28,500 --> 00:16:29,735
Something's up there.

185
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:32,180
Hold on, I think I can see inside.

186
00:16:32,760 --> 00:16:34,480
It's Dr. Vegapunk!

187
00:16:36,340 --> 00:16:38,720
I have a report from the Fabriophase!

188
00:16:39,140 --> 00:16:40,060
It's urgent!

189
00:16:40,280 --> 00:16:41,960
We've just spotted Vegapunk!

190
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:44,797
He's descending from the
Labophase in a vehicle!

191
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:45,710
Take aim!

192
00:16:45,793 --> 00:16:46,800
Prepare to fire!

193
00:16:57,580 --> 00:17:02,000
You have a new order,
direct from Dr. Vegapunk.

194
00:17:02,340 --> 00:17:08,360
Every Marine on the
island must be eliminated!

195
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:39,180
Oh, this is bad.

196
00:17:39,560 --> 00:17:41,100
I think it's on your nose.

197
00:17:41,880 --> 00:17:43,900
New target designated.

198
00:17:44,920 --> 00:17:47,080
Eliminate all Marines on Egghead.

199
00:17:52,780 --> 00:17:54,600
Get away from the pacifistas!

200
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:06,160
They have a new order. Dr.

201
00:18:06,280 --> 00:18:08,515
Vegapunk must have taken control back.

202
00:18:13,460 --> 00:18:15,000
So many pacifistas!

203
00:18:15,220 --> 00:18:17,455
How are we supposed to fight them all?

204
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:20,460
Damn you, Vegapunk!

205
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:23,190
Yeah!

206
00:18:23,273 --> 00:18:24,103
Now it's a party!

207
00:18:24,880 --> 00:18:26,900
Let her rip past the vistas!

208
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:31,657
Seems they're all
responding to the command.

209
00:18:31,740 --> 00:18:32,570
Yeah!

210
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:36,510
Hold up!

211
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:38,817
It looks like we're going straight down.

212
00:18:38,900 --> 00:18:41,457
We're not gonna dive bomb
into the ground, are we?

213
00:18:41,540 --> 00:18:43,020
We are on island clouds.

214
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:45,797
It's in their nature to
attach to one another.

215
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:48,233
Since our tiles are also made of clouds,

216
00:18:48,380 --> 00:18:50,877
we won't fall to our deaths
even if we head straight down.

217
00:18:50,960 --> 00:18:53,140
But enough about our ride!

218
00:18:53,420 --> 00:18:54,720
We must find Bonnie!

219
00:18:55,040 --> 00:18:57,660
She's surely alone and
terrified down there!

220
00:18:58,460 --> 00:18:59,290
Hey, Bonnie!

221
00:18:59,373 --> 00:19:01,240
Where are you? Bonnie!

222
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:03,080
Hey, Bonnie!

223
00:19:04,420 --> 00:19:05,250
Bonnie!

224
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:15,220
I need to focus.

225
00:19:15,600 --> 00:19:17,537
Don't think. Feel.

226
00:19:17,620 --> 00:19:23,660
I'll reach out across the entire universe
and sense her with the waves of my soul.

227
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:37,400
My lady dark on a ping I found her!

228
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:46,960
Same for me you sure don't question me
my lady door has never been wrong once.

229
00:19:48,760 --> 00:19:53,220
I dispute the science of your methods,
but I will trust your instinct.

230
00:19:53,480 --> 00:19:54,362
Thanks, Doctor.

231
00:19:55,280 --> 00:20:00,200
Now, if you'll all excuse me, this tank
just can't keep up with my impatient heart.

232
00:20:02,660 --> 00:20:04,160
Don't worry, Meat!

233
00:20:04,520 --> 00:20:05,800
I'm on my way!

234
00:20:08,080 --> 00:20:09,260
What a relief.

235
00:20:09,820 --> 00:20:12,585
Looks like the pacifistas
are back on our side.

236
00:20:23,520 --> 00:20:25,217
Thought you could hide huh?

237
00:20:25,300 --> 00:20:27,697
This is over, jewelry.

238
00:20:27,780 --> 00:20:32,940
Bonnie, you'll pay for what
you did to our men over there!

239
00:21:11,460 --> 00:21:13,960
Hey, what the hell's wrong with you three?

240
00:21:14,220 --> 00:21:16,860
I think I just went to hell.

241
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:19,760
Get back here!

242
00:21:19,900 --> 00:21:21,194
I'm not done with you!

243
00:21:25,280 --> 00:21:26,860
You cannot escape!

244
00:21:30,660 --> 00:21:31,780
Huh? Why?

245
00:21:32,860 --> 00:21:33,690
Ha!

246
00:21:33,773 --> 00:21:38,248
I can't command all the pacifistas, but
I snuck around the rules for this one.

247
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:42,500
I have the power to
control anything I sit on,

248
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:45,457
because I'm a driving human
who ate the radron fruit.

249
00:21:45,540 --> 00:21:47,305
Now, here's a little question.

250
00:21:47,620 --> 00:21:51,267
Will the curse you pleased on
our men be lifted if I kill you?

251
00:21:56,800 --> 00:21:57,630
Dad.

252
00:21:58,600 --> 00:21:59,980
Last chance, kiddo!

253
00:22:01,140 --> 00:22:02,920
Keep them back now!

254
00:22:07,360 --> 00:22:08,190
Huh?

255
00:22:11,540 --> 00:22:12,680
Come on, Bonnie.

256
00:22:12,980 --> 00:22:14,451
Don't zone out on us now.

257
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,300
Black leg.

258
00:22:18,340 --> 00:22:19,500
Look, I get it.

259
00:22:19,660 --> 00:22:21,954
It's because Kuma's your father, right?

260
00:22:25,380 --> 00:22:27,556
You have to remember they're not him.

261
00:22:27,780 --> 00:22:28,662
If you can't...

262
00:22:31,400 --> 00:22:32,600
Armor-clamber!

263
00:22:36,680 --> 00:22:37,798
Marines everywhere.

264
00:22:40,600 --> 00:22:42,040
Time for us to go.

265
00:22:42,260 --> 00:22:43,620
Go, pacifista!

266
00:22:44,180 --> 00:22:45,010
Fire!

267
00:22:47,620 --> 00:22:48,720
Ah, man!

268
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:02,560
Kicking the bubble, let's roll! Hurry!

269
00:23:03,440 --> 00:23:05,860
The pacifist will fire on us!

270
00:23:06,080 --> 00:23:07,017
Let's head back up!

271
00:23:07,100 --> 00:23:09,280
Oh, just shake it off already!

272
00:23:09,800 --> 00:23:11,100
Whoa! Oh!

273
00:23:18,140 --> 00:23:20,020
Oh, my God.

274
00:24:05,000 --> 00:24:09,400
It's no use resistance,
your fate is already sealed.

275
00:24:09,860 --> 00:24:11,800
This guy never learns.

276
00:24:14,220 --> 00:24:15,520
Uh-oh.

277
00:24:18,020 --> 00:24:18,850
Huh?

278
00:24:32,800 --> 00:24:37,260
Look, I don't know why you're doing
this, but I've got orders to follow.

279
00:24:40,140 --> 00:24:41,600
I don't care!

280
00:24:53,740 --> 00:24:55,200
The clock is ticking.

281
00:24:55,560 --> 00:24:56,913
Struggle while you can.

282
00:24:59,220 --> 00:25:01,300
You sure like to talk, don't you?

283
00:25:12,260 --> 00:25:13,920
If you'll excuse me,

284
00:25:14,080 --> 00:25:18,256
I have a mission to wrap up I bet
you were wasting too much of my time!

285
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:25,360
That's the idea!

286
00:25:26,700 --> 00:25:29,340
It's my mission to get in your way!

287
00:25:47,560 --> 00:25:48,390
Oh

288
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:53,600
What to do

289
00:26:10,840 --> 00:26:13,557
What's wrong?

290
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:14,920
It's weird!

291
00:26:15,720 --> 00:26:17,426
Something doesn't feel right.

292
00:26:17,720 --> 00:26:18,780
What is this?

293
00:26:19,120 --> 00:26:20,720
Such an unnatural presence.

294
00:26:38,040 --> 00:26:40,160
I can't believe what I'm seeing.

295
00:26:41,840 --> 00:26:44,780
All units, stand down.

296
00:26:53,180 --> 00:26:55,977
The pacifistas aren't
protecting us anymore.

297
00:26:56,060 --> 00:26:57,757
They're not even moving.

298
00:26:57,840 --> 00:26:59,677
Come on, I gave you an order!

299
00:26:59,760 --> 00:27:01,637
Eliminate all the marines.

300
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:03,920
You're supposed to keep us safe.

301
00:27:05,620 --> 00:27:06,914
Something's happening?

302
00:27:08,460 --> 00:27:12,107
There's only one group above
Vegapunk on the authority ladder.

303
00:27:12,860 --> 00:27:14,037
And that's.

304
00:27:14,120 --> 00:27:16,660
The Five Elders!

305
00:27:19,240 --> 00:27:20,860
What is that?

306
00:27:32,460 --> 00:27:34,180
It's a pentagram!

307
00:27:45,280 --> 00:27:46,480
What the hell?

308
00:27:46,660 --> 00:27:47,500
Step on it!

309
00:27:47,680 --> 00:27:49,600
Get to high ground! I'll try!

310
00:27:53,520 --> 00:27:54,920
Attention, all Marines!

311
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:57,640
Saint Saturn is on his way!

312
00:27:58,020 --> 00:28:00,020
He will arrive on Egghead shortly!

313
00:28:01,180 --> 00:28:05,356
Not a single Marine below the rank
of Commodore may be in his presence!

314
00:28:06,320 --> 00:28:08,680
He's coming here? I repeat!

315
00:28:09,060 --> 00:28:13,640
Saint Saturn of the Five Elders
will make landfall on Egghead!

316
00:28:21,660 --> 00:28:23,200
What was that explosion?

317
00:28:24,560 --> 00:28:28,384
One of the five elders, so I'm
shocked that they came and passed.

318
00:28:28,520 --> 00:28:29,560
The five elders?

319
00:28:29,840 --> 00:28:30,670
Never heard of them.

320
00:28:30,753 --> 00:28:31,583
Who are they?

321
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:34,080
The highest authorities in the bird.

322
00:28:34,360 --> 00:28:35,320
Wait, for real?

323
00:28:57,740 --> 00:28:59,328
Something big's coming out!

324
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:29,120
what the hell is that it's some
kind of monster Cut it out!

325
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:31,240
That must be...

326
00:29:40,700 --> 00:29:42,240
Ah, the surface.

327
00:29:42,920 --> 00:29:45,300
It's been quite a while.

328
00:29:49,820 --> 00:29:50,820
That's huge.

329
00:29:51,160 --> 00:29:52,278
What is that thing?

330
00:29:53,980 --> 00:29:55,760
Above us! Dodge!

331
00:30:01,480 --> 00:30:02,310
Oops.

332
00:30:02,393 --> 00:30:03,960
That was a close one.

333
00:30:04,340 --> 00:30:06,540
We don't have any clouds to get us!

334
00:30:09,320 --> 00:30:10,200
He's over!

335
00:30:14,620 --> 00:30:16,137
I found you!

336
00:30:16,220 --> 00:30:17,420
Get back here!

337
00:30:18,140 --> 00:30:20,920
Boy, you gotta be running out of juice.

338
00:30:21,180 --> 00:30:22,592
That form won't hold up.

339
00:30:22,900 --> 00:30:24,320
Do something, Luffy!

340
00:30:24,900 --> 00:30:26,340
What am I gonna do?

341
00:30:34,480 --> 00:30:36,500
I got you!

342
00:30:58,360 --> 00:30:59,360
Huh?

343
00:31:07,360 --> 00:31:09,140
Nope, I don't like that.

344
00:31:16,360 --> 00:31:17,190
Nika.

345
00:31:25,440 --> 00:31:28,100
Oh, my poop.

346
00:31:40,780 --> 00:31:43,240
You okay, Doc? Still breathing?

347
00:31:43,780 --> 00:31:46,097
So it would seem...

348
00:31:46,180 --> 00:31:48,200
Atlas, are you hurt? I'm okay.

349
00:31:55,140 --> 00:31:57,000
Are you St. Saturn?

350
00:31:57,380 --> 00:31:58,320
I am.

351
00:32:00,700 --> 00:32:04,640
I thought you were already dead, Vegapunk.

352
00:32:05,240 --> 00:32:06,500
What a shame.

353
00:32:12,820 --> 00:32:16,240
I gave you an order, Vegapunk

354
00:32:25,660 --> 00:32:26,980
Bonnie, wait!

355
00:32:29,540 --> 00:32:33,200
You must eliminate Kuma's free will

356
00:32:36,620 --> 00:32:39,740
But if I do that to him, thank you.

357
00:32:55,760 --> 00:32:57,360
I'll kill you!
